{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05303","headline":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得花字 · 赵彦伯","name":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得花字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九日报仙家，三秋转岁华。\n呼鹰下鸟路，戏马出龙沙。\n簪挂丹萸蘂，杯浮紫菊花。\n所愿同微物，年年共辟邪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05303.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05303","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}